{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07322","headline":"北游酬孟云卿见寄 · 刘长卿","name":"北游酬孟云卿见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽忽忘前事，事愿能相乖。\n衣马日羸弊，谁辨行与才。\n善道居贫贱，洁服蒙尘埃。\n行行无定止，懔坎难归来。\n慈母忧疾疹，室家念栖莱。\n幸君夙姻亲，深见中外怀。\n俟子惜时节，怅望临高台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07322.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07322","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}